From 9cd370021bd239e000abc9fba1486f1d9529d92d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Taimoor Ul Islam <tislam@iastate.edu>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 12:24:30 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 25/54] kaiair: true-SINR DL feedback (gNB half) + LDP delivery
 metrics

- 10-bit custom PUCCH CSI decode (decode_csi_10b_whole_reverse equivalent) in
  uci_cell_decoder under KAIAIR_CH4_CSI; fixed 10-bit part1 size override in
  get_csi_report_pucch_size keeps grant/FAPI/PHY/MAC sizing consistent
- UE-reported DL SINR plumbed uci_indication -> uci_action -> ue_cell: new DL
  pktr_link_state + SINR-mode DL power controller (EWMA-damped, gain 0.25,
  1 dB slew) chasing gamma_DL + Cantelli cushion; synthesized CQI keeps MCS
  adaptation alive; separate dl_sinr_target_db (env + live ctrl overlay)
- LDP delivery view: per-interval DL data-TB on-time/late/failed + tx-per-
  delivered counters (HARQ final-outcome classification, SRB exempt) emitted
  as ldp_* JSON fields; dl_sinr_true_db/dl_gamma_db/dl_sinr_target_db emitted
